WEBVTT

01:40.520 --> 01:45.850
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.350 --> 01:50.780
[Episode 18]

02:14.970 --> 02:17.150
If Jia Lan hadn't met me,

02:18.710 --> 02:21.360
she might not have
suffered so much in her life.

02:24.079 --> 02:26.400
I failed to keep her safe.

02:27.030 --> 02:27.960
So…

02:30.650 --> 02:32.810
I don't care how many people will die.

02:34.610 --> 02:37.140
I don't care if it'll cost me my life.

02:38.079 --> 02:41.210
You people don't deserve to live anyway.

03:38.430 --> 03:39.400
Jiuhuo.

03:53.120 --> 03:54.800
The Golden Dawn.

03:56.329 --> 03:57.370
Jiuhuo.

04:04.090 --> 04:05.460
The Golden Dawn.

04:05.480 --> 04:07.280
You've repaired the Golden Dawn?

04:07.280 --> 04:09.210
Whether it's for humans or demons,

04:09.960 --> 04:12.430
life is full of surprises.

04:14.240 --> 04:17.420
The Golden Dawn is in my hands now.

04:35.310 --> 04:37.370
I had given up hope,

04:37.560 --> 04:39.230
but unexpectedly,

04:39.950 --> 04:42.360
fortune smiled on me.

04:42.800 --> 04:44.720
I doubt you can stop me now.

04:47.830 --> 04:49.490
Let's go get Yitan and Quzhuo.

04:49.880 --> 04:50.480
After him.

05:24.160 --> 05:25.560
You've arrived just in time.

05:25.560 --> 05:26.800
Join me

05:26.870 --> 05:28.840
in welcoming Jia Lan's return.

05:29.250 --> 05:30.100
Break!

05:47.800 --> 05:49.200
She is

05:49.800 --> 05:52.860
the evil creature
we encountered beyond the Boundary:

05:53.490 --> 05:54.950
the Black Fox.

05:58.000 --> 05:59.070
Lord Jiuhuo,

05:59.460 --> 06:01.320
thank you for everything you did.

06:01.710 --> 06:02.870
Jia Lan.

06:08.480 --> 06:09.590
United as one.

06:15.800 --> 06:17.240
United as one?

06:17.740 --> 06:20.680
I despise such human nonsense the most.

06:23.560 --> 06:24.190
Quzhuo!

06:44.220 --> 06:46.980
The vessel for my soul is here as well.

06:49.830 --> 06:51.190
She's not a vessel.

06:52.040 --> 06:53.440
She is Dongfang Huaizhu!

06:54.950 --> 06:58.270
You speak as if you have any say in this.

07:15.600 --> 07:16.510
Quzhuo.

07:26.310 --> 07:27.160
Hongye.

07:27.980 --> 07:28.950
You all leave!

07:35.750 --> 07:39.950
My brother was a lunatic
obsessed with talismans.

07:40.950 --> 07:43.680
He left me thousands of them.

07:44.810 --> 07:45.960
Today,

07:46.390 --> 07:49.040
I'll show you what they can do.

08:06.870 --> 08:07.720
Quzhuo!

08:53.830 --> 08:56.740
Whether the ending can be changed or not,

08:57.370 --> 08:58.900
I, Li Quzhuo,

09:00.390 --> 09:03.670
was together with all my brothers

09:04.390 --> 09:06.290
from the Mask Group today.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.110
They're coming back.

09:23.960 --> 09:24.600
-Huaizhu.
-Hongye.

09:24.600 --> 09:25.320
-Zui.
-Zui.

09:26.000 --> 09:26.600
Hongye.

09:26.600 --> 09:27.150
Huaizhu.

09:27.670 --> 09:29.190
Zui, are you alright?

09:29.220 --> 09:29.550
I'm fine.

09:29.550 --> 09:30.150
How are you?

09:30.150 --> 09:30.790
Hongye.

09:30.900 --> 09:32.160
Huaizhu, are you okay?

09:32.550 --> 09:33.550
Hongye, Hongye!

09:33.550 --> 09:34.120
Hongye!

09:34.120 --> 09:34.670
Hongye.

09:44.760 --> 09:45.520
Huaizhu.

09:47.550 --> 09:48.280
Father.

09:52.030 --> 09:54.790
It's good that you're home.

09:57.200 --> 09:58.510
With me here,

09:59.080 --> 10:01.320
Young Master Wangquan will be fine.

10:07.470 --> 10:09.740
He brought you home safe.

10:10.080 --> 10:14.440
I didn't expect
someone so young to be so brave.

10:14.910 --> 10:15.750
Good.

10:24.030 --> 10:26.090
I'm relieved that Hongye is alright.

10:35.670 --> 10:36.670
Zui.

10:36.840 --> 10:38.530
This room has the best lighting.

10:38.530 --> 10:39.530
You can stay here.

10:39.700 --> 10:41.550
Young Master Yang will stay across from you.

10:41.550 --> 10:43.510
You guys must have a lot to talk about.

10:43.510 --> 10:44.720
I'll leave you to it.

10:45.790 --> 10:46.390
Thank you.

10:51.180 --> 10:52.790
This place looks great.

10:52.900 --> 10:54.840
Guess it was worth
getting dragged around by that girl

10:54.840 --> 10:56.240
to repair all the magical artifacts

10:56.240 --> 10:57.640
in the Divine Fire Villa.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.360
Li Quzhuo.

11:01.240 --> 11:02.120
Stand up.

11:03.200 --> 11:03.790
What for?

11:11.000 --> 11:11.510
I...

11:11.530 --> 11:14.100
Y-You… W-What…

11:14.790 --> 11:15.850
What are you doing?

11:17.910 --> 11:19.710
It's really wonderful to see you

11:19.750 --> 11:20.810
as soon as I'm back.

11:21.460 --> 11:22.810
From now on,

11:23.320 --> 11:24.920
I won't bully you ever again.

11:25.230 --> 11:28.380
I'll be a thousand times nicer to you.

11:30.360 --> 11:31.670
Zui,

11:33.080 --> 11:34.550
you've changed.

11:36.080 --> 11:36.720
Come on.

11:37.910 --> 11:39.240
Call me Fourth Brother.

11:41.840 --> 11:42.770
Fourth Brother.

11:44.630 --> 11:45.560
Fourth Brother.

11:47.120 --> 11:48.120
Fourth Brother!

11:50.120 --> 11:51.520
Tell me, what do you want?

11:51.600 --> 11:53.200
I will do everything possible

11:53.200 --> 11:54.390
to get it for you.

11:56.510 --> 11:58.110
I just want you to stay alive.

12:00.240 --> 12:01.270
And you guys,

12:02.610 --> 12:04.140
I want you to stay alive too.

12:06.720 --> 12:07.270
Well…

12:11.910 --> 12:12.790
Something really bad

12:12.790 --> 12:14.990
happened 20 years in the future, right?

12:20.000 --> 12:21.000
So,

12:21.720 --> 12:23.960
20 years later,
in the war between humans and demons,

12:23.960 --> 12:28.160
the Yiqi Alliance was destroyed,
and the Mask Group suffered heavy losses.

12:28.980 --> 12:30.020
And I

12:31.080 --> 12:33.320
was the one who lived the longest.

12:34.720 --> 12:36.320
You only made it back alive

12:37.750 --> 12:39.510
because I

12:39.910 --> 12:41.350
sacrificed myself?

12:43.590 --> 12:46.490
So I was still super dope when I was old!

12:51.320 --> 12:53.440
Why the long faces? You're all back now.

12:53.440 --> 12:54.910
It means the ending
can definitely be changed.

12:54.910 --> 12:56.110
Don't look so gloomy.

12:56.390 --> 12:57.080
Smile.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.080
You're right.

13:02.600 --> 13:03.870
Since we're all back,

13:04.340 --> 13:05.940
there must still be a chance.

13:06.630 --> 13:09.560
Right. There's something
I need to discuss with you.

13:09.630 --> 13:12.120
This magical artifact—
making and activating it

13:12.120 --> 13:14.320
requires an enormous amount of energy.

13:15.120 --> 13:16.360
This golden lotus

13:16.510 --> 13:17.870
is basically wrecked.

13:18.840 --> 13:20.600
But if I carefully repair it,

13:20.790 --> 13:22.120
there's a chance it could be restored.

13:22.120 --> 13:23.320
It must be destroyed.

13:24.720 --> 13:26.120
Is it possible for Jiuhuo

13:26.870 --> 13:27.870
to make

13:27.870 --> 13:29.280
an exact replica of this thing?

13:29.280 --> 13:30.480
That's not possible.

13:30.750 --> 13:32.080
This golden lotus may not look like much,

13:32.080 --> 13:33.200
but every component inside

13:33.200 --> 13:34.360
is a rare treasure.

13:34.840 --> 13:35.550
Good.

13:36.150 --> 13:38.030
So we must destroy this thing

13:38.440 --> 13:39.830
to cut off any chance

13:40.000 --> 13:42.600
for Jiuhuo and the Black Fox
to enter our world.

13:52.520 --> 13:59.040
[Shennong's Herbal Classics]

14:04.560 --> 14:06.600
If one of us must die,

14:07.590 --> 14:08.990
that person won't be you.

14:09.120 --> 14:10.550
She's not a vessel.

14:11.440 --> 14:13.030
She is Dongfang Huaizhu!

14:14.830 --> 14:16.190
Why would you

14:16.680 --> 14:18.680
go that far to save me?

14:20.620 --> 14:22.380
I've never thought about it.

14:23.100 --> 14:24.960
Then what have you thought about?

14:25.160 --> 14:26.620
That I must never lose you.

14:36.510 --> 14:37.270
Senior.

14:37.740 --> 14:39.190
Master sent me to tell you

14:39.280 --> 14:40.560
that Young Master Wangquan is fine.

14:40.560 --> 14:41.460
You don't need to worry.

14:41.460 --> 14:42.790
I'll go check on him now.

14:44.590 --> 14:45.540
Junior Huaizhu,

14:46.640 --> 14:50.160
when did you
hook up with Young Master Wangquan?

14:52.470 --> 14:55.710
As your senior, I didn't even notice.

14:57.620 --> 15:00.420
My affairs are none of your concern.

15:06.990 --> 15:09.940
You favor Wangquan Hongye so much.

15:10.090 --> 15:13.350
Isn't it just because
he's the heir of the Wangquan family?

15:13.430 --> 15:15.000
One day,

15:15.390 --> 15:19.670
I, Jin Renfeng,
will crush him beneath my feet.

15:46.960 --> 15:47.750
Yitan.

15:48.320 --> 15:50.320
Are you still thinking about Mu Mie?

15:52.670 --> 15:54.870
When the Black Fox breaks the Boundary,

15:55.030 --> 15:56.360
eternal night befalls.

15:57.130 --> 15:59.530
I wonder how things
will turn out for Mu Mie.

16:05.030 --> 16:07.510
Mu Mie's personality is just like yours.

16:07.750 --> 16:10.720
I believe he won't give up hope.

16:11.580 --> 16:14.890
Besides, as long as we change the future,

16:16.320 --> 16:17.750
he'll be safe for sure.

16:26.270 --> 16:29.000
Of course, if you really miss him,

16:29.240 --> 16:31.370
after Aunt Yang Yan gives birth to him,

16:31.670 --> 16:34.000
we'll go see him together. How about that?

16:35.910 --> 16:37.440
Mu Mie did mention

16:38.000 --> 16:39.660
that when he was six years old,

16:40.010 --> 16:42.040
a masked guy

16:42.060 --> 16:44.260
taught him to awaken his Clairvoyance.

16:45.200 --> 16:47.440
But Quzhuo said

16:47.870 --> 16:49.150
that two years later,

16:49.550 --> 16:51.200
we'd all be dead.

16:52.030 --> 16:55.960
Then who is that masked guy who will teach Mu Mie

16:56.200 --> 16:57.270
Clairvoyance?

16:57.320 --> 17:00.080
Enough. Don't say we'll die again.

17:00.570 --> 17:01.410
Zui,

17:02.120 --> 17:03.870
you'll surely live a long life.

17:08.750 --> 17:09.750
You too, Yitan.

17:10.170 --> 17:11.770
You'll also live a long life.

17:12.550 --> 17:13.510
Because

17:14.290 --> 17:16.750
I'll never leave your side in this lifetime.

17:23.750 --> 17:24.550
Alright.

17:31.350 --> 17:32.400
Then…

17:33.880 --> 17:36.920
If I were to marry someone else,

17:37.730 --> 17:39.350
would you still be like this?

17:39.720 --> 17:42.400
Would you still
stay by my side so devotedly?

17:46.510 --> 17:47.200
I would.

17:58.510 --> 18:01.110
Yitan, that's a good answer.

18:03.910 --> 18:05.510
But it's not the one I wanted.

18:21.350 --> 18:22.510
That golden lotus—

18:23.920 --> 18:25.790
you really burned it with a fire talisman?

18:25.790 --> 18:26.310
Yes.

18:26.960 --> 18:29.070
Don't worry. I burned it to ashes.

18:29.590 --> 18:30.510
Gosh. You...

18:30.510 --> 18:32.030
You're too brutal!

18:32.030 --> 18:33.590
That magical artifact cost a fortune!

18:33.590 --> 18:35.270
You should've at least picked a good day

18:35.270 --> 18:36.870
and given it a grand funeral!

18:37.450 --> 18:38.250
You're right.

18:38.750 --> 18:39.880
I'll keep that in mind next time.

18:39.880 --> 18:40.400
I...

18:47.750 --> 18:48.790
What's wrong?

18:49.160 --> 18:49.960
Nothing.

18:51.270 --> 18:52.750
Look at your pouty face.

18:53.110 --> 18:54.790
Come on, tell me. Who upset you?

18:54.790 --> 18:56.590
I'll teach them a lesson for you.

19:07.160 --> 19:09.790
Is it someone from the Divine Fire Villa?

19:10.240 --> 19:12.900
It's that Jin Renfeng
with slanted eyes, right?

19:13.510 --> 19:14.440
No.

19:15.000 --> 19:17.600
It has nothing to do
with the Divine Fire Villa.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.000
Then who is it?

19:22.270 --> 19:23.070
Yitan?

19:28.400 --> 19:29.650
I knew it!

19:29.680 --> 19:31.590
It must be
because of that arranged marriage.

19:31.590 --> 19:33.550
It's bothering you a lot, right?

19:34.070 --> 19:34.920
Don't worry.

19:35.350 --> 19:37.070
I'll go talk some sense into him right away.

19:37.070 --> 19:38.960
Today, I'll make that brat
write you a letter

19:38.960 --> 19:40.440
to break off the engagement.

19:40.440 --> 19:41.830
As soon as he's done writing,

19:41.830 --> 19:44.350
I'll rush it to the Wangquan Manor.

19:44.440 --> 19:46.330
By then, before you even arrive,

19:47.030 --> 19:49.270
you'll already be free.

19:51.070 --> 19:52.510
I'm the best, aren't I?

19:57.720 --> 19:58.880
Don't worry, Zui.

19:59.070 --> 20:01.030
Yitan definitely has feelings for you.

20:01.030 --> 20:02.030
I swear.

20:02.310 --> 20:03.200
Really?

20:07.680 --> 20:08.640
What do you mean?

20:09.560 --> 20:11.770
Are you blind or what?

20:12.000 --> 20:13.200
Haven't you noticed?

20:13.400 --> 20:15.260
Since Zui returned from Sky City,

20:15.750 --> 20:17.880
the way she looks at Yitan has changed.

20:18.430 --> 20:19.760
She's already...

20:20.030 --> 20:22.070
a young woman who's fallen in love.

20:24.160 --> 20:24.880
She...

20:28.440 --> 20:29.110
Don't tell me

20:29.110 --> 20:31.160
you've fallen for Yang Yitan!

20:35.710 --> 20:36.580
You fool!

20:36.750 --> 20:38.550
Can't you get a grip on yourself?

20:45.360 --> 20:47.490
Don't tell me he doesn't like you back!

21:14.750 --> 21:16.070
Why are you up?

21:16.640 --> 21:17.310
Sit down.

21:26.610 --> 21:29.010
You've been taking care of me all this time?

21:30.660 --> 21:32.870
You're much better now. Good.

21:37.880 --> 21:38.790
Thank you.

21:44.290 --> 21:45.750
Take your medicine first.

21:48.030 --> 21:49.290
What about the others?

21:49.440 --> 21:51.590
They're all fine. Don't worry.

21:53.270 --> 21:54.110
That's good.

22:00.850 --> 22:02.250
What did you dream about?

22:06.640 --> 22:08.200
Every year on your death anniversary,

22:06.770 --> 22:12.590
[To Hongye
From Huaizhu]

22:08.590 --> 22:10.030
she'd bring a letter

22:10.720 --> 22:12.440
to your cenotaph.

22:13.880 --> 22:15.340
There aren't many letters

22:16.070 --> 22:20.190
because 10 years
after you went beyond the Boundary,

22:23.560 --> 22:25.020
she passed away.

22:27.390 --> 22:29.090
Wangquan Hongye,

22:29.480 --> 22:31.860
you're destined to lose your loved one.

22:32.030 --> 22:34.510
All struggles are futile.

22:38.900 --> 22:40.140
I dreamed…

22:42.110 --> 22:43.710
we were very happy together.

22:44.460 --> 22:45.830
So happy that

22:46.310 --> 22:47.880
you gritted your teeth

22:48.310 --> 22:49.710
and furrowed your brows?

22:54.790 --> 22:55.720
The wound hurts.

22:58.110 --> 23:00.700
Miss, if Young Master Wangquan is awake,

23:00.750 --> 23:02.410
Master wants him to come over.

23:02.770 --> 23:04.690
Alright, I see.

23:08.270 --> 23:09.800
Your father wants to see me?

23:15.350 --> 23:16.310
I should go then.

23:17.940 --> 23:19.270
You're going like this?

23:21.310 --> 23:22.570
When you see my father,

23:22.590 --> 23:24.640
don't be nervous. Relax.

23:34.850 --> 23:35.780
I'm not nervous.

23:49.160 --> 23:50.680
The last dish is here!

23:51.680 --> 23:52.590
Eat up.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.440
Father, try a drumstick.

23:56.350 --> 23:58.960
Qinlan, go back to your room and rest.

23:59.310 --> 24:03.350
I need to
have a few words with Young Master Wangquan.

24:04.070 --> 24:05.830
He's not your son-in-law.

24:05.920 --> 24:07.720
What do you have to say to him?

24:08.030 --> 24:09.030
I'll just sit here

24:09.400 --> 24:10.600
and pour wine for you.

24:19.310 --> 24:22.510
Sitting stiffly like this

24:23.030 --> 24:24.310
isn't comfortable.

24:25.270 --> 24:27.680
Why don't we relax a little?

24:28.240 --> 24:29.030
Alright.

24:34.640 --> 24:35.750
I have diabetes.

24:36.000 --> 24:37.000
I can't drink alcohol.

24:37.000 --> 24:39.030
You can help yourself to the wine.

24:40.400 --> 24:41.030
Okay.

24:46.920 --> 24:48.120
To you, Mr. Dongfang.

24:51.720 --> 24:55.510
In the south, we always
have vinegar with our cold dishes.

24:56.630 --> 24:58.260
You just drank vinegar.

25:06.830 --> 25:07.830
It's appetizing.

25:12.070 --> 25:13.270
Can you cook?

25:13.470 --> 25:14.380
A real man

25:15.750 --> 25:16.790
stays away from the kitchen.

25:16.790 --> 25:17.550
Is that so?

25:18.470 --> 25:22.320
These are all dishes that Huaizhu loves.

25:23.350 --> 25:24.400
I made them.

25:29.240 --> 25:30.170
A true gentleman

25:31.070 --> 25:32.270
is good at cooking.

25:33.820 --> 25:38.160
So, Young Master, are you a real man

25:38.270 --> 25:40.720
or a true gentleman?

25:41.590 --> 25:42.440
Well,

25:44.310 --> 25:46.550
that depends on you, Mr. Dongfang.

25:48.330 --> 25:49.660
I can be either.

25:51.400 --> 25:54.110
I've heard that you're decisive and ruthless,

25:54.270 --> 25:56.680
an unyielding tough guy.

25:57.820 --> 25:59.750
I don't like tough guys.

26:01.160 --> 26:02.640
Your ambition is to rule the world,

26:02.640 --> 26:04.240
and you're destined for greatness.

26:04.240 --> 26:05.960
Because of this, you

26:06.070 --> 26:07.200
can't make pastries

26:07.200 --> 26:08.550
or cook fish soup.

26:08.640 --> 26:11.960
You can't take good care of my Huaizhu.

26:14.240 --> 26:15.110
I can learn.

26:15.160 --> 26:16.720
You know what I mean.

26:18.200 --> 26:21.450
Huaizhu doesn't like power struggles,

26:21.550 --> 26:25.790
but you're at the center of that storm.

26:32.750 --> 26:35.550
Mr. Dongfang, please give me some time.

26:35.790 --> 26:38.030
I'll certainly take care of everything.

26:38.030 --> 26:39.560
As long as Huaizhu is happy,

26:39.680 --> 26:41.920
I don't mind plain meals

26:42.350 --> 26:43.350
and a quiet life.

26:46.720 --> 26:47.750
You know what?

26:48.400 --> 26:51.450
A lot of suitors
have come to ask for her hand,

26:51.510 --> 26:52.920
but none of them

26:52.920 --> 26:54.350
have had the privilege

26:54.350 --> 26:57.350
of pouring me a cup of wine.

27:01.790 --> 27:02.350
Yes.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.440
Mr. Dongfang.

27:17.430 --> 27:19.020
I like that smile of yours.

27:19.320 --> 27:20.070
Don't sit there

27:20.070 --> 27:21.880
like the stone lion outside my gate.

27:21.880 --> 27:23.390
Come on, relax.

27:23.640 --> 27:25.590
Let's have a good drink together
as father and son.

27:25.590 --> 27:26.440
Sure.

27:26.510 --> 27:27.910
Thank you, Mr. Dongfang.

27:28.000 --> 27:28.790
Come on.

27:30.680 --> 27:31.050
Cheers.

27:31.050 --> 27:31.720
Cheers.

27:33.720 --> 27:35.680
Don't drink alone.

27:35.680 --> 27:37.110
I…

27:38.070 --> 27:40.000
F-From now on,

27:40.350 --> 27:42.030
if anyone else comes to propose,

27:42.030 --> 27:43.310
I'll tell them

27:44.110 --> 27:48.830
Huaizhu is already spoken for.

27:51.310 --> 27:52.510
That's so kind of you.

27:53.400 --> 27:55.430
You're so kind, Mr. Dongfang.

27:55.640 --> 27:57.930
S-Stop calling me Mr. Dongfang.

27:58.240 --> 27:59.370
Call me Big Brother.

28:00.680 --> 28:01.410
Big Brother.

28:04.750 --> 28:08.020
I have everything here at home,

28:08.160 --> 28:10.310
except for good wine.

28:12.400 --> 28:13.130
Big Brother,

28:14.110 --> 28:15.110
I have good wine.

28:15.830 --> 28:17.110
I'll have someone bring it over.

28:17.110 --> 28:17.960
Bring it over.

28:19.640 --> 28:20.680
Bro.

28:21.070 --> 28:22.940
Have you kept in mind

28:23.240 --> 28:24.510
everything I told you?

28:25.790 --> 28:27.250
You're looking down on me.

28:27.310 --> 28:28.420
Are you looking down on me?

28:28.420 --> 28:29.620
Let me prove it to you.

28:29.880 --> 28:30.880
L-Let me…

28:30.880 --> 28:31.510
Go ahead.

28:31.510 --> 28:32.030
Let me…

28:32.830 --> 28:33.680
Let me…

28:36.640 --> 28:38.850
Huaizhu likes to eat

28:39.110 --> 28:40.440
steamed lamb,

28:40.510 --> 28:41.790
steamed bear paw,

28:41.830 --> 28:43.000
steamed deer tail,

28:43.000 --> 28:43.830
roasted duck,

28:43.830 --> 28:44.790
roasted chick,

28:44.790 --> 28:45.830
roasted gosling,

28:46.000 --> 28:47.000
braised meat, braised duck,

28:47.000 --> 28:48.720
soy sauce chicken,
cured meat, and pork knuckle with pine nuts…

28:48.720 --> 28:50.400
Who said I like all those things?

28:50.400 --> 28:51.440
Who said that?

28:53.560 --> 28:55.290
Big Brother, I think I'm drunk.

28:55.890 --> 28:57.030
Is Huaizhu here?

28:58.510 --> 28:59.750
I saw her too.

29:00.270 --> 29:04.520
First, who allowed you to drink, Father?

29:04.640 --> 29:06.640
Who allowed it?

29:07.960 --> 29:10.310
Second, was wine not enough

29:10.640 --> 29:11.880
that you had to drink vinegar too?

29:11.880 --> 29:13.350
That was vinegar!

29:13.510 --> 29:15.160
-What vinegar?
-Vinegar…

29:15.270 --> 29:18.470
Who said the Divine Fire Villa doesn't have good wine?

29:18.750 --> 29:20.380
Who said that?

29:20.920 --> 29:21.680
I did.

29:21.680 --> 29:22.920
Throw him out!

29:23.460 --> 29:24.070
Out?

29:24.070 --> 29:25.790
My bro and I haven't had enough yet.

29:25.790 --> 29:27.200
Not enough.

29:27.200 --> 29:28.350
Bring more wine.

29:29.830 --> 29:31.230
We've got plenty of wine.

29:31.510 --> 29:32.510
I'll have Huaizhu bring it for you!

29:32.510 --> 29:33.440
Bring… Bring it.

29:33.440 --> 29:34.160
Huaizhu,

29:34.160 --> 29:34.790
go get some wine.

29:34.790 --> 29:35.780
Go get it now.

29:36.400 --> 29:37.270
Someone!

29:37.510 --> 29:38.310
Miss Huaizhu.

29:38.310 --> 29:40.240
Bring them another pot of vinegar.

29:40.240 --> 29:41.680
Let them sober up properly.

29:41.680 --> 29:42.310
Yes.

29:42.350 --> 29:43.510
Come on, bro.

29:44.510 --> 29:45.030
I can't drink anymore.

29:45.030 --> 29:46.350
Take it, take it.

29:46.710 --> 29:47.390
Here.

29:48.070 --> 29:49.920
Bro, drink.

30:10.680 --> 30:11.510
You're awake?

30:20.440 --> 30:21.700
Huaizhu, yesterday…

30:27.160 --> 30:27.750
My…

30:28.490 --> 30:29.300
My throat…

30:32.400 --> 30:34.730
Young Master Wangquan not only loves wine

30:34.790 --> 30:36.050
but also vinegar, huh?

30:38.160 --> 30:39.140
Vinegar?

30:39.350 --> 30:40.480
You don't remember?

30:41.070 --> 30:43.760
Then let me remind you.

30:44.240 --> 30:47.540
Besides rattling off dish names all night,

30:47.680 --> 30:50.340
you also said
my father's cooking was too bland.

30:51.480 --> 30:54.090
You even became sworn brothers with him.

30:54.640 --> 30:56.400
So now I should call you—

30:58.190 --> 30:59.050
That's enough.

31:00.590 --> 31:01.510
That's enough.

31:08.510 --> 31:10.840
Drink this hangover soup and then go back.

31:18.030 --> 31:19.510
You're not angry, are you?

31:19.640 --> 31:20.830
Vinegar isn't expensive.

31:20.830 --> 31:21.960
Why would I be angry?

31:22.990 --> 31:25.440
Besides, you slept well last night.

31:25.830 --> 31:28.030
Your inner energy has also stabilized.

31:28.400 --> 31:29.210
Then…

31:30.160 --> 31:32.760
Don't you have
important matters to attend to?

31:41.310 --> 31:43.830
Take two of these pills a day.

31:44.030 --> 31:45.510
They're enough for seven days.

31:45.510 --> 31:46.680
After seven days…

31:47.350 --> 31:48.950
I'll come to get more myself.

31:54.800 --> 31:57.310
Huaizhu, Young Master Wangquan and the others have left?

31:57.310 --> 31:58.310
They've all left.

31:58.760 --> 32:01.110
Great! Peace and quiet at last.

32:01.160 --> 32:02.030
I thought

32:02.030 --> 32:04.490
they'd stick around and keep pestering you.

32:05.160 --> 32:07.070
They have important matters to attend to.

32:07.070 --> 32:09.350
Why? You seem to dislike him.

32:09.920 --> 32:11.550
It's not that I dislike him.

32:11.750 --> 32:13.920
I just prefer the masked guy.

32:15.260 --> 32:16.210
Got that?

32:16.400 --> 32:18.790
Where are you going to collect herbs today?

32:18.790 --> 32:19.640
Miss Huaizhu,

32:19.790 --> 32:21.790
we are going to Mount Cangyun today.

32:30.510 --> 32:31.550
What's wrong?

32:34.310 --> 32:36.350
Mount Cangyun is full of steep cliffs.

32:36.350 --> 32:37.590
They're going to collect herbs

32:37.590 --> 32:39.590
but didn't bring any climbing gear.

32:40.790 --> 32:41.880
Now that you mention it,

32:41.880 --> 32:43.400
it does seem a bit odd.

32:44.880 --> 32:45.650
Qinlan,

32:46.310 --> 32:47.750
while I was away,

32:48.110 --> 32:50.310
did the rare herbs collected in the villa

32:50.310 --> 32:51.800
actually increase?

32:52.550 --> 32:55.350
Our income
has increased quite a bit because of it.

32:59.070 --> 32:59.960
Strange.

33:00.350 --> 33:02.070
Qinlan, go gather all the disciples.

33:02.070 --> 33:02.790
I need to ask them something.

33:02.790 --> 33:03.310
Okay.

33:04.110 --> 33:06.170
This Wangquan Sword is newly forged.

33:06.680 --> 33:08.540
Young Master, please take a look.

33:10.440 --> 33:13.070
What a pity. A fake is still a fake.

33:13.160 --> 33:15.880
It'll never become
the true greatest sword in the world.

33:15.880 --> 33:16.550
Mr. Fei.

33:17.200 --> 33:18.930
Do you remember the dream I had?

33:19.290 --> 33:21.440
The so-called Eternal Night
is actually the Black Fox.

33:21.440 --> 33:24.240
My father must have discovered something
beyond the Boundary,

33:24.240 --> 33:25.300
but he can't return

33:25.550 --> 33:26.880
and has to bide his time.

33:27.790 --> 33:29.190
Young Master, do you mean

33:30.070 --> 33:32.000
you want to go beyond the Boundary?

33:32.070 --> 33:33.270
Don't worry, Mr. Fei.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.260
The battle at Sky City

33:35.440 --> 33:37.160
has shown me the power of the Black Fox.

33:37.160 --> 33:38.490
I won't act recklessly.

33:39.270 --> 33:41.750
I'll definitely find the Black Fox's weakness,

33:41.750 --> 33:42.750
find my father,

33:43.200 --> 33:45.130
and claim the true Wangquan Sword.

33:48.520 --> 33:54.970
[Great Virtue Carries All Things]

33:49.510 --> 33:53.310
Thousand-year-old ginseng,
Dendrobium officinale, and Clubmoss

33:53.590 --> 33:54.920
are all worth a fortune.

33:55.160 --> 33:57.400
These herbs grow on steep cliffs.

33:58.030 --> 33:59.590
How did you gather them?

34:00.570 --> 34:01.490
Naturally,

34:02.040 --> 34:04.550
we climbed up there
and picked them ourselves.

34:04.550 --> 34:07.000
Show me your hands.

34:13.639 --> 34:17.159
It's inevitable to get scratched
gathering herbs on a mountain,

34:17.159 --> 34:19.270
but your hands and feet
don't have any scratches,

34:19.270 --> 34:20.870
and your clothes are intact.

34:20.960 --> 34:21.670
Tell me,

34:22.070 --> 34:24.600
how did you obtain these herbs?

34:25.190 --> 34:27.670
That's right. Confess now.

34:28.360 --> 34:30.360
Don't make me force it out of you.

34:37.150 --> 34:38.070
Jin Renfeng.

34:39.840 --> 34:42.110
You've enslaved demons to gather herbs.

34:42.850 --> 34:45.909
That's strictly forbidden
by the Divine Fire Villa.

34:46.550 --> 34:47.480
Do you admit your fault?

34:47.480 --> 34:50.860
Master, it's the survival of the fittest.

34:51.170 --> 34:52.719
I've merely enslaved a few demons

34:52.719 --> 34:54.000
and made them gather herbs

34:54.000 --> 34:55.070
to strengthen us.

34:55.550 --> 34:56.880
What's wrong with that?

35:03.060 --> 35:06.860
The Divine Fire Villa
has always treated humans and demons equally.

35:07.150 --> 35:10.930
But now, all you see is strength and weakness,

35:11.070 --> 35:12.280
not right and wrong.

35:13.320 --> 35:14.030
Well then,

35:15.110 --> 35:17.470
I'd like to challenge you

35:17.590 --> 35:20.310
and see just how strong you really are.

35:20.490 --> 35:21.690
All of you, step back.

35:24.630 --> 35:26.990
[Great Virtue Carries All Things]

35:24.800 --> 35:27.070
Alright, let's have a fire duel.

35:28.510 --> 35:30.240
Master, please be our witness.

35:49.000 --> 35:49.990
Junior Huaizhu,

35:50.240 --> 35:52.070
you've mastered the Pure Yang Flame?
